# Firebase service-account keys — NEVER commit. Real keystore lives at
# ~/Documents/Builds/BION-secrets/firebase/ and the JSON is provisioned to
# Render env (FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON) for backend push fan-out.
# google-services.json + GoogleService-Info.plist are NOT secrets and ARE
# committed (they only contain bundle-id-scoped public identifiers).
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
fcm-service-account.json
